{
  "kicker": "Inflation",
  "headline": "The Inflation Rate Is Falling. Your Wallet Is Not.",
  "dek": "Official metrics suggest prices are cooling, but the cumulative cost of the last five years has outpaced real wage growth, leaving the median household feeling squeezed despite improving nominal figures.",
  "keyPoints": [
